WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.887 --> 00:00:12.667
was confused.

2
00:00:12.687 --> 00:00:14.707
"Where's the emergency?"

3
00:00:15.568 --> 00:00:16.368
Pam sighed.

4
00:00:17.168 --> 00:00:19.029
"There's no emergency."

5
00:00:19.049 --> 00:00:22.630
"What?" Roxy stamped her foot.

6
00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.650
"Why did you call the police?"

7
00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:26.791
Pam sighed.

8
00:00:26.811 --> 00:00:29.711
"We're sorry."

9
00:00:30.532 --> 00:00:31.292
Cam nodded.

10
00:00:31.852 --> 00:00:33.173
"Very sorry."

11
00:00:33.193 --> 00:00:36.895
"Huh?" Roxy scratched her head.

12
00:00:36.915 --> 00:00:41.217
"We'll never frame you again," Pam said.

13
00:00:42.017 --> 00:00:43.178
Cam crossed her heart.

14
00:00:43.198 --> 00:00:45.099
"We promise."

15
00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:47.140
Roxy frowned.

16
00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.661
"I'm still mad.

17
00:00:49.081 --> 00:00:51.082
But I accept your apology."

18
00:00:52.283 --> 00:00:52.983
Roxy left.

19
00:00:54.604 --> 00:00:58.166
Cam and Pam burst out laughing.

20
00:00:58.566 --> 00:01:01.588
"Our trap worked!"

21
00:01:02.032 --> 00:01:02.652
Pam said.

22
00:01:02.672 --> 00:01:04.854
"Rocket Girl came!"

23
00:01:06.034 --> 00:01:06.735
Cam nodded.

24
00:01:06.755 --> 00:01:09.576
"And she didn't spot that!"

25
00:01:10.617 --> 00:01:12.578
Cam pointed at a tiny video camera.

26
00:01:14.619 --> 00:01:15.720
Police knocked on the door.

27
00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:18.862
"There's no emergency here!"

28
00:01:19.322 --> 00:01:19.942
Pam said.

29
00:01:20.623 --> 00:01:21.643
She slammed the door.

30
00:01:21.663 --> 00:01:23.504
"Let's get to work!"

31
00:01:24.225 --> 00:01:25.566
Cam opened her laptop.

32
00:01:26.226 --> 00:01:27.567
She clicked on a video file.

33
00:01:28.047 --> 00:01:29.508
It was from the tiny camera.

34
00:01:30.088 --> 00:01:32.009
It showed the twins talking to Rocket Girl.

35
00:01:32.869 --> 00:01:34.550
Then she opened another video file.

36
00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:37.070
It showed the twins pretending to fight.

37
00:01:38.071 --> 00:01:39.231
The safe was behind them.

38
00:01:40.091 --> 00:01:40.792
Cam giggled.

39
00:01:40.812 --> 00:01:45.413
"Now I'll use my special video-editing software."

40
00:01:46.294 --> 00:01:47.254
She typed commands.

41
00:01:48.154 --> 00:01:50.495
"I remove myself from the fight video.

42
00:01:51.175 --> 00:01:53.396
Then I insert Rocket Girl."

43
00:01:56.536 --> 00:02:00.918
"It looks like I'm fighting Rocket Girl now," Pam said.

44
00:02:00.938 --> 00:02:05.820
"Now I add Rocket Girl's voice," Cam said.

45
00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:12.523
"It sounds just like her," Pam said.

46
00:02:12.543 --> 00:02:15.864
"Cam, you're a genius!"

47
00:02:16.584 --> 00:02:17.485
Cam smiled.

48
00:02:17.505 --> 00:02:21.306
"Hopefully this video will get lots of views!"

49
00:02:25.804 --> 00:02:27.806
Jack, Mara, and Terrell watched the new video.

50
00:02:27.826 --> 00:02:29.967
"Give me the money in the safe!"

51
00:02:30.427 --> 00:02:31.248
Rocket Girl yelled.

52
00:02:31.268 --> 00:02:34.570
"Never!" Pam punched and kicked.

53
00:02:35.311 --> 00:02:36.892
Finally Rocket Girl flew away.

54
00:02:38.973 --> 00:02:40.194
Pam looked into the camera.

55
00:02:40.214 --> 00:02:42.276
"There you go, folks!

56
00:02:42.896 --> 00:02:45.398
Rocket Girl tried to steal our money.

57
00:02:46.119 --> 00:02:48.320
Luckily I fought her off!"

58
00:02:49.141 --> 00:02:50.382
Cam's head popped into view.

59
00:02:50.402 --> 00:02:53.464
"Please click the Subscribe button!"

60
00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:55.840
Terrell bit his lip.

61
00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:58.561
"That was definitely fake.

62
00:02:59.201 --> 00:03:01.002
Nobody can fight off Rocket Girl."

63
00:03:05.583 --> 00:03:06.703
Roxy sat on a building.

64
00:03:06.723 --> 00:03:10.684
"I should go back to jail," she thought.

65
00:03:10.704 --> 00:03:13.485
"But Detective Smith and I are innocent."

66
00:03:14.625 --> 00:03:15.226
She stood up.

67
00:03:15.246 --> 00:03:17.806
"I'll go and tell Mayor Bloom."

68
00:03:19.727 --> 00:03:20.907
Roxy flew over the city.

69
00:03:21.827 --> 00:03:22.608
"Rocket Girl!"

70
00:03:22.948 --> 00:03:23.568
a man yelled.

71
00:03:27.456 --> 00:03:28.656
Roxy landed in the street.

72
00:03:28.676 --> 00:03:30.057
"Do you need help?"

73
00:03:30.337 --> 00:03:30.857
she asked.

74
00:03:31.717 --> 00:03:32.978
A crowd gathered around her.

75
00:03:32.998 --> 00:03:37.259
"The Tattle Twins posted a new video," a kid said.

76
00:03:37.279 --> 00:03:39.300
"You're a bad guy!"

77
00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:40.960
A woman frowned.

78
00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:44.501
"You tried to steal from those twins!"

79
00:03:44.521 --> 00:03:48.603
"Oh no!"

80
00:03:49.243 --> 00:03:50.083
Roxy groaned.

81
00:03:50.103 --> 00:03:52.224
"Pam and Cam tricked me!"

82
00:03:55.304 --> 00:03:57.905
Meanwhile three men also watched the new video.

83
00:03:58.625 --> 00:03:59.966
They looked mean and tough.

84
00:04:00.946 --> 00:04:02.327
One of them stroked his beard.

85
00:04:02.347 --> 00:04:06.389
"So There's money in that safe, huh?"
